# Resume tree — PRIVATE BY DEFAULT.
# Reorganised 2026-09-02: the old `resume/drafts/` folder is gone and active
# documents now sit directly under resume/, so a path-specific ignore is no
# longer safe. Everything under resume/ is ignored; only the README map is
# tracked. The tree holds phone number, full employment history, salary bands,
# gap analyses and Brandon's rulings (see mirror-resume-tree.ps1 § PRIVACY,
# and CB-649: this same material once sat one command from publication).
# To publish a resume deliberately, add it with an explicit `git add -f`.
resume/*
!resume/README.md
